# Later: apartment map location (owner listings)

Owners must be able to set the **real pin location** of each apartment (lat/lng), not only nearest university / city fallbacks.

Students should then see:
- the apartment on the map
- **how far it is from their university** (computed distance), not only a manual campus-km chip

Today `ListingEditor` still derives `lat`/`lng` from nearest university or city when saving. Replace that with an owner-picked map pin (and keep/recompute distance to the student’s university on search/detail).

Do not treat this as done until pin pick + student-facing distance are shipped.
